{"id":"01ab533da9c8c517","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-machine-coding.md","title":"Program and Configuration Coding","display":"df-machine-coding — Program and Configuration Coding","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-machine-coding","aliases":["90-df-machine-coding"],"display":"df-machine-coding — Program and Configuration Coding","depends_on":["[[90-df-configuration]]","[[90-df-sequence]]","[[90-df-sequence-encoding]]","[[90-lem-sequence-coding]]","[[90-df-encoding]]","[[90-df-turing-machine]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-machine-coding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-machine-coding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-machine-coding — Program and Configuration Coding"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3953b8fffc6e6551\" href=\"?note=3953b8fffc6e6551\" title=\"90-df-configuration\">90-df-configuration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4293e1643a9254d8\" href=\"?note=4293e1643a9254d8\" title=\"90-df-sequence\">90-df-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5dc32170bd55a322\" href=\"?note=5dc32170bd55a322\" title=\"90-df-sequence-encoding\">90-df-sequence-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1cdf7925a164f89d\" href=\"?note=1cdf7925a164f89d\" title=\"90-lem-sequence-coding\">90-lem-sequence-coding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8f303a307372354c\" href=\"?note=8f303a307372354c\" title=\"90-df-encoding\">90-df-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"82c921b871f2639b\" href=\"?note=82c921b871f2639b\" title=\"90-df-turing-machine\">90-df-turing-machine</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,z,y,a,b,h,i,j,n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e,z,y,a,b,h,i,j,n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；数值序列的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Seq},\\operatorname{Len},(s)_i\">\\(\\operatorname{Seq},\\operatorname{Len},(s)_i\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4293e1643a9254d8\" href=\"?note=4293e1643a9254d8\" title=\"90-df-sequence\">90-df-sequence</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5dc32170bd55a322\" href=\"?note=5dc32170bd55a322\" title=\"90-df-sequence-encoding\">90-df-sequence-encoding</a>；原始递归性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"1cdf7925a164f89d\" href=\"?note=1cdf7925a164f89d\" title=\"90-lem-sequence-coding\">90-lem-sequence-coding</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\cdots\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\cdots\\rangle\\)</span> 在数值编码表达式中使用第 90 本编码。机器、配置、函数图等集合论元组统一使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\cdots)\">\\((\\cdots)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}\\)</span> 的参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(x_i)_{i&lt;n}\">\\((x_i)_{i&lt;n}\\)</span> 是集合论有限列。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Conf}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Step}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{Step}_M\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"3953b8fffc6e6551\" href=\"?note=3953b8fffc6e6551\" title=\"90-df-configuration\">90-df-configuration</a>，机器元组与方向符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,R\">\\(L,R\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"82c921b871f2639b\" href=\"?note=82c921b871f2639b\" title=\"90-df-turing-machine\">90-df-turing-machine</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(w\\in\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；输入词使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"8f303a307372354c\" href=\"?note=8f303a307372354c\" title=\"90-df-encoding\">90-df-encoding</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{wordenc}\">\\(\\operatorname{wordenc}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>下式定义整个程序呈示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\mapsto M_e\">\\(e\\mapsto M_e\\)</span>、数值配置编解码以及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(U:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\">\\(\\ell\\)</span> 仅用于下述空白符为零的有限支撑纸带；非法程序、非法配置码和非法历史的分支均显式给出。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"82c921b871f2639b\" href=\"?note=82c921b871f2639b\" title=\"90-df-turing-machine\">90-df-turing-machine</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Conf}\">\\(\\mathrm{Conf}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"3953b8fffc6e6551\" href=\"?note=3953b8fffc6e6551\" title=\"90-df-configuration\">90-df-configuration</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{blank}\">\\(\\mathrm{blank}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{loop}\">\\(\\mathrm{loop}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nn\\mathbin{\\dot{-}}m&amp;\\coloneqq\\max\\{n-m,0\\},\\\\\nq_0(e)&amp;\\coloneqq(e)_0,\\qquad g_0(e)\\coloneqq(e)_1,\\qquad d_e\\coloneqq(e)_2,\\\\\nA(e,i)&amp;\\coloneqq((d_e)_i)_0,\\quad B(e,i)\\coloneqq((d_e)_i)_1,\\quad C(e,i)\\coloneqq((d_e)_i)_2,\\\\\n\\operatorname{ProgCode}(e)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Seq}(e)\\land\\operatorname{Len}(e)=3\\land q_0(e)\\ge3\\land g_0(e)\\ge3\n\\land\\operatorname{Seq}(d_e)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\operatorname{Len}(d_e)=(q_0(e)\\mathbin{\\dot{-}}2)g_0(e)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i&lt;(q_0(e)\\mathbin{\\dot{-}}2)g_0(e)\\ \\bigl[\n\\operatorname{Seq}((d_e)_i)\\land\\operatorname{Len}((d_e)_i)=3\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{19em}\\land A(e,i)&lt;q_0(e)\\land B(e,i)&lt;g_0(e)\\land C(e,i)\\in\\{0,1\\}\\bigr],\\\\\nq(e)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}q_0(e),&amp;\\operatorname{ProgCode}(e),\\\\3,&amp;\\neg\\operatorname{ProgCode}(e),\\end{cases}\\\\\ng(e)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}g_0(e),&amp;\\operatorname{ProgCode}(e),\\\\3,&amp;\\neg\\operatorname{ProgCode}(e),\\end{cases}\\\\\nD_0&amp;\\coloneqq L,\\qquad D_1\\coloneqq R,\\\\\n\\delta_{\\mathrm{loop}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{((0,b),(0,b,R)):b&lt;3\\},\\\\\n\\delta_e&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{((a,b),(A(e,ag(e)+b),B(e,ag(e)+b),D_{C(e,ag(e)+b)})):\na&lt;q(e)-2\\land b&lt;g(e)\\},&amp;\\operatorname{ProgCode}(e),\\\\\n\\delta_{\\mathrm{loop}},&amp;\\neg\\operatorname{ProgCode}(e),\n\\end{cases}\\\\\nM_{\\mathrm{loop}}&amp;\\coloneqq(\\{0,1,2\\},\\{1,2\\},\\{0,1,2\\},0,\\delta_{\\mathrm{loop}},0,1,2),\\\\\nM_e&amp;\\coloneqq(\\{a\\in\\mathbb N:a&lt;q(e)\\},\\{1,2\\},\\{b\\in\\mathbb N:b&lt;g(e)\\},\n0,\\delta_e,0,q(e)-2,q(e)-1),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\quad M_e\\in\\mathrm{TM},\\qquad\n\\neg\\operatorname{ProgCode}(e)\\Longrightarrow M_e=M_{\\mathrm{loop}}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nn\\mathbin{\\dot{-}}m&amp;\\coloneqq\\max\\{n-m,0\\},\\\\\nq_0(e)&amp;\\coloneqq(e)_0,\\qquad g_0(e)\\coloneqq(e)_1,\\qquad d_e\\coloneqq(e)_2,\\\\\nA(e,i)&amp;\\coloneqq((d_e)_i)_0,\\quad B(e,i)\\coloneqq((d_e)_i)_1,\\quad C(e,i)\\coloneqq((d_e)_i)_2,\\\\\n\\operatorname{ProgCode}(e)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Seq}(e)\\land\\operatorname{Len}(e)=3\\land q_0(e)\\ge3\\land g_0(e)\\ge3\n\\land\\operatorname{Seq}(d_e)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\operatorname{Len}(d_e)=(q_0(e)\\mathbin{\\dot{-}}2)g_0(e)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i&lt;(q_0(e)\\mathbin{\\dot{-}}2)g_0(e)\\ \\bigl[\n\\operatorname{Seq}((d_e)_i)\\land\\operatorname{Len}((d_e)_i)=3\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{19em}\\land A(e,i)&lt;q_0(e)\\land B(e,i)&lt;g_0(e)\\land C(e,i)\\in\\{0,1\\}\\bigr],\\\\\nq(e)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}q_0(e),&amp;\\operatorname{ProgCode}(e),\\\\3,&amp;\\neg\\operatorname{ProgCode}(e),\\end{cases}\\\\\ng(e)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}g_0(e),&amp;\\operatorname{ProgCode}(e),\\\\3,&amp;\\neg\\operatorname{ProgCode}(e),\\end{cases}\\\\\nD_0&amp;\\coloneqq L,\\qquad D_1\\coloneqq R,\\\\\n\\delta_{\\mathrm{loop}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{((0,b),(0,b,R)):b&lt;3\\},\\\\\n\\delta_e&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{((a,b),(A(e,ag(e)+b),B(e,ag(e)+b),D_{C(e,ag(e)+b)})):\na&lt;q(e)-2\\land b&lt;g(e)\\},&amp;\\operatorname{ProgCode}(e),\\\\\n\\delta_{\\mathrm{loop}},&amp;\\neg\\operatorname{ProgCode}(e),\n\\end{cases}\\\\\nM_{\\mathrm{loop}}&amp;\\coloneqq(\\{0,1,2\\},\\{1,2\\},\\{0,1,2\\},0,\\delta_{\\mathrm{loop}},0,1,2),\\\\\nM_e&amp;\\coloneqq(\\{a\\in\\mathbb N:a&lt;q(e)\\},\\{1,2\\},\\{b\\in\\mathbb N:b&lt;g(e)\\},\n0,\\delta_e,0,q(e)-2,q(e)-1),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\quad M_e\\in\\mathrm{TM},\\qquad\n\\neg\\operatorname{ProgCode}(e)\\Longrightarrow M_e=M_{\\mathrm{loop}}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\na(z)&amp;\\coloneqq(z)_0,\\qquad t(z)\\coloneqq(z)_1,\\qquad h(z)\\coloneqq(z)_2,\\\\\n\\operatorname{CCode}(e,z)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Seq}(z)\\land\\operatorname{Len}(z)=3\\land a(z)&lt;q(e)\n\\land\\operatorname{Seq}(t(z))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land(\\forall j&lt;\\operatorname{Len}(t(z))\\ (t(z))_j&lt;g(e))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\bigl(\\operatorname{Len}(t(z))=0\\lor\n(t(z))_{\\operatorname{Len}(t(z))\\mathbin{\\dot{-}}1}\\ne0\\bigr),\\\\\n\\tau_t(j)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}(t)_j,&amp;j&lt;\\operatorname{Len}(t),\\\\0,&amp;j\\ge\\operatorname{Len}(t),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\tau_{\\mathrm{blank}}(j)&amp;\\coloneqq0,\\\\\n\\operatorname{DecConf}_e(z)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}(a(z),\\tau_{t(z)},h(z)),&amp;\\operatorname{CCode}(e,z),\\\\\n(0,\\tau_{\\mathrm{blank}},0),&amp;\\neg\\operatorname{CCode}(e,z),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\ell(\\tau)&amp;\\coloneqq\\min\\{n\\in\\mathbb N:\\forall j\\in\\mathbb N\\ (j\\ge n\\Longrightarrow\\tau(j)=0)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{EncConf}_e(a,\\tau,h)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle a,\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}((\\tau(j))_{j&lt;\\ell(\\tau)}),h\\rangle\n\\quad((a,\\tau,h)\\in\\mathrm{Conf}_{M_e}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{DecConf}_e&amp;:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathrm{Conf}_{M_e},\\\\\n\\operatorname{EncConf}_e&amp;:\\mathrm{Conf}_{M_e}\\to\\mathbb N,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Conf}_{M_e}\\quad\n\\operatorname{CCode}(e,\\operatorname{EncConf}_e(c))\\land\n\\operatorname{DecConf}_e(\\operatorname{EncConf}_e(c))=c,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall z\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\\operatorname{CCode}(e,z)\\Longrightarrow\n\\operatorname{EncConf}_e(\\operatorname{DecConf}_e(z))=z.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\na(z)&amp;\\coloneqq(z)_0,\\qquad t(z)\\coloneqq(z)_1,\\qquad h(z)\\coloneqq(z)_2,\\\\\n\\operatorname{CCode}(e,z)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Seq}(z)\\land\\operatorname{Len}(z)=3\\land a(z)&lt;q(e)\n\\land\\operatorname{Seq}(t(z))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land(\\forall j&lt;\\operatorname{Len}(t(z))\\ (t(z))_j&lt;g(e))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\bigl(\\operatorname{Len}(t(z))=0\\lor\n(t(z))_{\\operatorname{Len}(t(z))\\mathbin{\\dot{-}}1}\\ne0\\bigr),\\\\\n\\tau_t(j)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}(t)_j,&amp;j&lt;\\operatorname{Len}(t),\\\\0,&amp;j\\ge\\operatorname{Len}(t),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\tau_{\\mathrm{blank}}(j)&amp;\\coloneqq0,\\\\\n\\operatorname{DecConf}_e(z)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}(a(z),\\tau_{t(z)},h(z)),&amp;\\operatorname{CCode}(e,z),\\\\\n(0,\\tau_{\\mathrm{blank}},0),&amp;\\neg\\operatorname{CCode}(e,z),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\ell(\\tau)&amp;\\coloneqq\\min\\{n\\in\\mathbb N:\\forall j\\in\\mathbb N\\ (j\\ge n\\Longrightarrow\\tau(j)=0)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{EncConf}_e(a,\\tau,h)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle a,\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}((\\tau(j))_{j&lt;\\ell(\\tau)}),h\\rangle\n\\quad((a,\\tau,h)\\in\\mathrm{Conf}_{M_e}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{DecConf}_e&amp;:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathrm{Conf}_{M_e},\\\\\n\\operatorname{EncConf}_e&amp;:\\mathrm{Conf}_{M_e}\\to\\mathbb N,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Conf}_{M_e}\\quad\n\\operatorname{CCode}(e,\\operatorname{EncConf}_e(c))\\land\n\\operatorname{DecConf}_e(\\operatorname{EncConf}_e(c))=c,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall z\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\\operatorname{CCode}(e,z)\\Longrightarrow\n\\operatorname{EncConf}_e(\\operatorname{DecConf}_e(z))=z.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{in}}_w(j)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}w_j+1,&amp;j&lt;|w|,\\\\0,&amp;j\\ge|w|,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\tau_w&amp;\\coloneqq\\tau^{\\mathrm{in}}_w,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Init}(e,\\vec x)&amp;\\coloneqq(0,\\tau^{\\mathrm{in}}_{\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\vec x)},0),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Step}(e,c,c&#39;)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{Step}_{M_e}(c,c&#39;),\\\\\n\\operatorname{CStep}(e,z,z&#39;)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{CCode}(e,z)\\land\\operatorname{CCode}(e,z&#39;)\\land\n\\operatorname{Step}(e,\\operatorname{DecConf}_e(z),\\operatorname{DecConf}_e(z&#39;)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{in}}_w(j)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}w_j+1,&amp;j&lt;|w|,\\\\0,&amp;j\\ge|w|,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\tau_w&amp;\\coloneqq\\tau^{\\mathrm{in}}_w,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Init}(e,\\vec x)&amp;\\coloneqq(0,\\tau^{\\mathrm{in}}_{\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\vec x)},0),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Step}(e,c,c&#39;)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{Step}_{M_e}(c,c&#39;),\\\\\n\\operatorname{CStep}(e,z,z&#39;)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{CCode}(e,z)\\land\\operatorname{CCode}(e,z&#39;)\\land\n\\operatorname{Step}(e,\\operatorname{DecConf}_e(z),\\operatorname{DecConf}_e(z&#39;)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nz_*(y)&amp;\\coloneqq(y)_{\\operatorname{Len}(y)\\mathbin{\\dot{-}}1},\\qquad\nt_*(y)\\coloneqq(z_*(y))_1,\\\\\n\\operatorname{OutShape}(y)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Seq}(y)\\land\\operatorname{Len}(y)&gt;0\\land\\operatorname{Seq}(z_*(y))\n\\land\\operatorname{Len}(z_*(y))=3\\land\\operatorname{Seq}(t_*(y)),\\\\\nU(y)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\n\\min\\bigl(\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j&lt;\\operatorname{Len}(t_*(y))\\land(t_*(y))_j\\ne2\\}\n\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Len}(t_*(y))\\}\\bigr),&amp;\\operatorname{OutShape}(y),\\\\\n0,&amp;\\neg\\operatorname{OutShape}(y),\n\\end{cases}\\\\\nU&amp;:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nz_*(y)&amp;\\coloneqq(y)_{\\operatorname{Len}(y)\\mathbin{\\dot{-}}1},\\qquad\nt_*(y)\\coloneqq(z_*(y))_1,\\\\\n\\operatorname{OutShape}(y)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Seq}(y)\\land\\operatorname{Len}(y)&gt;0\\land\\operatorname{Seq}(z_*(y))\n\\land\\operatorname{Len}(z_*(y))=3\\land\\operatorname{Seq}(t_*(y)),\\\\\nU(y)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\n\\min\\bigl(\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j&lt;\\operatorname{Len}(t_*(y))\\land(t_*(y))_j\\ne2\\}\n\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Len}(t_*(y))\\}\\bigr),&amp;\\operatorname{OutShape}(y),\\\\\n0,&amp;\\neg\\operatorname{OutShape}(y),\n\\end{cases}\\\\\nU&amp;:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>编码层选择在原文未指定处补全；不改变半无限纸带、有限计算历史、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CompCode}\">\\(\\operatorname{CompCode}\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HaltSeq}\">\\(\\operatorname{HaltSeq}\\)</span> 的对象。接受与拒绝两个终态都作为计算终止，而非把拒绝解释为发散。程序编号不由通用机器接口逐个数值复制；两种纸带与输入输出约定经有效编译相互模拟，不能仅凭相同自然数就认定为同一程序。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-configuration","status":"resolved","id":"3953b8fffc6e6551","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-configuration]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"4293e1643a9254d8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sequence-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"5dc32170bd55a322","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-sequence-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-lem-sequence-coding","status":"resolved","id":"1cdf7925a164f89d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-lem-sequence-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"8f303a307372354c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"82c921b871f2639b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","he